iakum County came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years for August to September, the most of any pair since 1951. In 2025, June to July on the middle of the grids ran 27% of normal. July to August is the driest pair at 2.33 inches normal and November to December the wettest at 24.02 inches. Grid 31526 had its driest year in 2019 at 66%.</p>"}
